. *── Helper: scrive una riga in un CSV ───────────────────────────────────────
> ─
. capture program drop wrow

. program define wrow
  1.     args csv line
  2.     file open fh using "`csv'", write append text
  3.     file write fh `"`line'"' _n
  4.     file close fh
  5. end

